- project = portfolio_project(portfolio_jumpix_path)
= content_for :body_class, 'portfolio-template'

/!  Begin Page Content
section.hero.d-flex
  .container-lg
    .squiggle.mb-5
    .row.justify-content-start.align-items-center
      .col-md-6.col-lg-6
		h1 = project[:title]
        p.lead
        	| Jumpix is a web-based application designed to help users access and move files across major cloud providers through a single, unified platform. The product simplifies file management across multiple cloud accounts and environments, making access easy regardless of where files are stored.
		/ .d-inline.mb-5.mb-md-0
		/ 	p.offline Website Temporarily Offline
      .col-md-6.col-lg-6
        .row.mb-3
			.col-md-6
				h6 Client
				p Jumpix
			.col-md-6
				h6 Year
				p 2013 - 2016
        .row.mb-3
			.col-md-6
				h6 Services
				p Strategy, Website Design & Development, UX/UI Design, Graphic Design, Iconography, Media, Email Campaigns
			.col-md-6
				h6 Technologies
				p HTML/SCSS, Ruby on Rails, Slim Lang, Twitter Bootstrap, Github, Illustrator, After Effects

/! Project Summary
