	.container
		.row
			.col-lg-12
				.squiggle
				h6.text-center.mb-3 Project at a glance
				h2.text-center From idea to experience.
				p.lead.text-center.mb-5
		  			| Helped bring Jumpix from an early-stage concept to a customer-facing digital experience, contributing across strategy, user research, UX/UI, web development, marketing, and launch initiatives.
		.row.highlights
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-lightbulb
				h5 Product strategy
				p Collaborated with the team on early brainstorming, planning, positioning, and ideas for how Jumpix could simplify managing multiple cloud accounts.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-users-viewfinder
				h5 User research
				p Helped conduct an eight-participant focus group at the Art Institute of Houston to gather feedback on the website, application, and future features.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-pen-ruler
				h5 Design & development
				p Designed website and application experiences and contributed to front-end development across the customer-facing platform.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-bullhorn
				h5 Marketing & growth
				p Created marketing collateral and supported promotional initiatives, hiring events, and other activities surrounding the growing startup.
		.row
			.text-center
				= link_to "#challenge", class: "anchor-link" do
					| explore full project
					i.fad.fa-arrow-down.ms-2

/! Challenge
section#challenge.challenge
  .container
	.row.align-items-center.g-5
	  .col-lg-5
		h2 The challenge

		p.lead.text-mb-5
		  | As an early-stage product, Jumpix needed to introduce a new concept to users: managing files across multiple cloud storage providers from one centralized platform. The experience needed to make that concept easy to understand while giving users a simple way to connect accounts, organize content, and move files between services.

		p.lead
		  | The challenge extended beyond the application itself. We were also defining how Jumpix should be positioned, marketed, and introduced to potential users while continuing to learn which features and capabilities mattered most to them.

	  .col-lg-7
		= link_to image_path("portfolio/jumpix/showcase-jumpix.png"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Jumpix Website" do
			= image_tag "portfolio/jumpix/jumpix-website.webp", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Jumpix Website Showcase"
		p.small.text-center.mt-3.mb-0
		  | Jumpix marketing website introducing the platform, connected cloud services, and core functionality.

/! Approach
section#approach
  .container
	.row.g-5
		.col-lg-5.position-sticky.mx-auto.top-0.vh-100
			h2 My approach
			p.lead.mb-4
				| I worked closely with the CEO, founders, and CTO as Jumpix evolved from an early-stage concept into a customer-facing platform. My role spanned strategy, UX/UI, front-end development, user research, and marketing, helping shape both the product experience and how Jumpix was introduced to potential users.
			.approach-steps
				.approach-step.mb-4
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-lightbulb
						h5 Plan & strategize
					p Collaborated with the CEO, founders, and CTO on product ideas, positioning, features, marketing initiatives, and the overall direction of the Jumpix experience.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-users-viewfinder
						h5 Research & learn
					p Planned and coordinated a focus group at the Art Institute of Houston to evaluate the website and application, gather feedback, and identify opportunities for future features.
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-pen-ruler
						h5 Design, build & refine
					p Designed and developed the customer-facing experience using Ruby on Rails, Slim, SCSS, and JavaScript, collaborating closely with the CTO to translate product requirements into an accessible, intuitive interface.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-rocket-launch
						h5 Support launch & growth
					p Created marketing collateral and supporting digital assets while contributing to promotional, recruiting, and event initiatives around the startup.
		.col-lg-7
			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4.mb-5
				h6.mb-2 UX/UI + Development
				h3 Designing the Jumpix experience
				p.mb-4 Designed the website and application experience to make managing multiple cloud services simple and approachable, while collaborating with the CTO on front-end development and evolving functionality.
				.row.g-4
					.col-md-6
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/jumpix/jumpix-dashboard-showcase.jpg"), :class=>"thumbnail", "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Jumpix App - Dashboard" do
							= image_tag "portfolio/jumpix/jumpix-dashboard-showcase.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Jumpix App - Dashboard"
